r the  longest accurate archery shot and i shot  an arrow and hit a target from 310 yards  away  i want my kids to see that no matter  what the challenge is you can overcome  it you just have to put your head down  and push through and figure out a way to  be successful figure out a way to just  you know be a good person while you do  all that stuff at the end of the day i  just want to be the best in the world i  don't care if you have arms you don't  have arms i don't care if you were the  michael jordan of the sport and you're  an able-bodied archer i just want to  beat you because i want to be known as  the best archer in the world  you
 

